  - name: sand
    reflectivity: 0.5
    label: 1
    textureAmp: 0
  - name: clay
    reflectivity: 0.45
    label: 1
    textureAmp: 0
  provenance: "Bottom type INFERRED from slope, roughness and depth at 0.125 m, with
    the SAME thresholds build_splatmap.py uses at 1 m. Bedrock rises from 34.9 %
    to 46.7 % over this footprint: the rules did not change, the cell size did \u2014
    a 1 m grid averages a boulder into gentle ground. Still inferred, not surveyed."
